#!/usr/bin/env bash
## tdjtab manifest -- tier-1 runs for the TD-JEPA-protocol OGBench proprio table (2026-09-07).
## Source of truth: docs/notes/2026-09-07-tdjepa-table-needed-runs.md section 2 (enumerated: 167 runs;
## the doc's earlier "161" undercounted fb_tdj and density_fb by 3 each -- see section 4 there).
## GENERATED (scripts/launch_tdjtab.sh reads it); one run per line, format
##     # <domain>/<critic>/s<seed> :: <fully expanded command>   [## RESUME note]
## Every run line starts with '#', so sourcing this file is a no-op; the launcher selects lines by regex on
## the run id and executes the text between ' :: ' and any trailing ' ## ' with $GPU set.
## Conventions: --save_dir exp/tdjtab for fresh runs; the 12 resumes (rldp/density_fb/rldp_density on cube)
## carry NO --save_dir so --auto_resume finds exp/<env>_<critic>_flowbc_seed_<s>/params_500000.pkl.
## Density-family runs carry measure_density_hard=true (+ latent_centered for density_fb_z) and the per-env
## measure_hit_spec (quoted: a single block would otherwise be parsed as a sexagesimal number).
## Every reward-inference-capable run (all critics except goal-conditioned density_fb/density_fb_state) carries the eval_relabel_* flags on every env (Route B in-run; smoked on antmaze/scene/puzzle 2026-09-07).
## antmaze runs carry actor.bc_coeff=0.3. Count check: grep -cE "^# [a-z0-9_]+/[a-z0-9_]+/s[0-9] :: " scripts/tdjtab_manifest.sh == 167
